 implies the printed one. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.lem-half-endpoint-kills"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.lem-half-endpoint-kills"],"id":"long.lem-half-endpoint-kills","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Lemma 6.38 (No finite Mersenne sum equals one half)","locator":"Long record Lemma 6.38, p. 55, label lem:half-endpoint-kills","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For every finite $u\\subseteq\\mathbb N_{>0}$, $X_u(2)\\ne1/2$: its reduced denominator is odd. Also $X_u(2)+R_d\\ne1/2$ for every $d\\ge0$, since $R_d$ is the irrational full Mersenne sum minus a finite rational sum. These observations exclude equality at the finite-prefix and complete-tail endpoints of Lemma 6.36.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.lem-half-endpoint-kills","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.lem-half-endpoint-kills","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.lem-half-endpoint-kills%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.half_ne_coe_finset_add_mersenneTail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.lem-half-endpoint-kills%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.half_ne_coe_finset_add_mersenneTail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.half_ne_coe_finset_add_mersenneTail"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.lem-half-endpoint-kills","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.lem-half-endpoint-kills%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.positiveM